Changes: expanded from 11 to ~200 symbols grouped by topic with units, typical values and chapter links; added conventions, symbol clashes, units cheat sheet and a unit-converter; corrected "relaxation rates" → time constants, units of $\vec M$ ([T] → A/m), $I_Z$ → $I$, $k$ → $k_B$, $B_1$ in mT → µT, and $B_0(1+\sigma)$ → $B_0(1-\sigma)$.*
